  "editNote": "Spell rank corrected to the book: page 215 prints \"4th charm (×3), suggestion (×3), 3rd sleep; 2nd illusory disguise (at will), …\" (a comma where the rank changes); the source runs sleep into the 4th rank and the errata does not touch it. Strike trait corrected to the book: page 215 prints \"scimitar +19 (forceful +2, sweep)\"; the source links it to a trait that does not exist. Matriarch's Caress corrected to the book: page 215 prints \"As Lamia's Caress, but DC 28, and the creature is stupefied 2 (or has its existing stupefied increased by 2) if it critically fails\"; the source applies the doubled values to any failure and the errata does not touch it."
